And that's if I did the right thing and put the `WindowDescriptor` before the `DefaultPlugins`. If I put the plugins before the resource (which is a common enough mistake), it doesn't crash anymore, but now I have two things that fail silently - the initial window settings AND the system that's trying to change the window settings.

